          </zone>
          <zone h='40792' id='11' name='Regional Strategic Matrix' w='47416' x='51917' y='17750'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='40791' id='12' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='58542'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='16'>KEY BUSINESS INSIGHTS</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>What?</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='13'>1) West leads revenue at ₹40.40M, but Central leads profit at ₹2.37M and margin at 6.11%.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='13'>2) Fashion leads category sales at ₹39.25M, while Beauty &amp; Personal Care has the lowest category margin at 4.56%.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='13'>3) Female customers generate higher sales, but male customers deliver the stronger margin (5.25% vs 4.88%).</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>Why?</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='13'>1) Revenue leadership does not necessarily translate into profitability. Regional and category performance should therefore be evaluated using both sales and margin.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='13'>2) Customer segments also differ in profitability, indicating that revenue-based targeting alone may overlook higher-margin opportunities.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='15'>Action?</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='13'>Prioritize profitable growth: investigate Central&apos;s stronger economics, review lower-margin categories, and develop segment-specific strategies based on customer value and profitability.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
