    <dashboard name='Executive Overview' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='16'>CAPSTONE PROJECT STORY</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='width' value='812' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1200' maxwidth='1200' minheight='1200' minwidth='1200' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98666' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='667'>
            <zone h='2417' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98666' x='667' y='667' />
            <zone fixed-size='193' h='16083' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98666' x='667' y='3084' />
            <zone h='80166' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98666' x='667' y='19167'>
              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW&#9;&#10;&#10;Business performance remains strong across sales, profitability, customers and products, but revenue leadership does not always translate into superior profitability. The analysis therefore focuses on identifying the customers, products and regions that create the greatest business value.&#10;&#10;The business generated approximately ₹186.98M in sales and ₹9.46M in profit, resulting in an overall profit margin of approximately 5.06%. The objective of this analysis is to understand what is driving these results and identify areas where management can prioritize profitable growth.&#10;' captured-sheet='04 - Strategic &amp; KPI Summary' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;CUSTOMER INSIGHTS&#10;&#10;Female customers generate the highest sales, while male customers deliver a higher margin. Married customers contribute more sales and profit than single customers, highlighting the importance of profitability-based customer segmentation.' captured-sheet='01 - Customer Overview' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;PRODUCT PERFORMANCE&#10;&#10;Fashion leads category sales, while Beauty &amp; Personal Care generates comparatively lower profitability. Product decisions should therefore consider sales, profit and margin together rather than sales volume alone.' captured-sheet='02 - Product &amp; Category Peformance' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption='&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;REGIONAL &amp; SALES PERFORMANCE&#10;&#10;West generates the highest sales, while Central generates the highest profit and profit margin. This demonstrates that revenue leadership does not necessarily translate into profitability leadership.' captured-sheet='03 - Regional &amp; Sales Performance' id='4' />
                  <story-point caption='&#9;&#9;&#9;&#9;STRATEGIC RECOMMENDATIONS&#10;&#10;Prioritize profitable growth by focusing on high-value customers, protecting strong-performing categories, reviewing lower-margin segments, and investigating the practices behind Central&apos;s stronger regional profitability.&#10;&#10;I started by understanding who our customers are and how different customer segments contribute to revenue and profitability. I then analyzed product and category performance to identify the products driving value. Next, I examined regional and temporal performance to understand where the business is strongest and where profitability differs from revenue performance. Finally, I consolidated these findings into strategic recommendations focused on profitable growth.' captured-sheet='04 - Strategic &amp; KPI Summary' id='5' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{C6DD965B-5641-4DC1-A94D-9C862D583390}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
